{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49491","headline":"河传 三 · 顾敻","name":"河传 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"櫂举，舟去。\n波光渺渺，不知何处。\n岸花汀草共依依，雨微，鹧鸪相逐飞。\n天涯离恨江声咽，啼猿切。\n此意向谁说，倚兰桡。\n独无憀，魂销，小炉香欲焦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾敻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49491.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49491","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}